{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"弥迦书","commonName":"弥迦书","title":"弥迦书","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"5d5b897647548ba0f6a03c05fd8c35d9e107b33b299c49301880b3a83eca015c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["欺压者的命运"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"祸哉，那些在床上图谋罪孽、造作奸恶的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天一发亮，因手有能力就行出来了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们贪图田地就占据，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贪图房屋便夺取；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们欺压人，霸占房屋和产业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"所以耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我筹划灾祸降与这族；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这祸在你们的颈项上不能解脱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们也不能昂首而行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这时势是恶的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，必有人向你们提起悲惨的哀歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讥刺说：我们全然败落了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华将我们的分转归别人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"何竟使这分离开我们？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他将我们的田地分给悖逆的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以在耶和华的会中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必没有人拈阄拉准绳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"他们","poem":1},{"noteId":2},{"text":"说：你们不可说预言；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可向这些人说预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不住地羞辱我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家啊，岂可说耶和华的心不忍耐吗","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些事是他所行的吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我—耶和华的言语岂不是与行动正直的人有益吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"然而，近来我的民兴起如仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从那些安然经过不愿打仗之人身上剥去外衣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们将我民中的妇人从安乐家中赶出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又将我的荣耀从她们的小孩子尽行夺去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们起来去吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这不是你们安息之所；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为污秽使人","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":"毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且大大毁灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若有人心存虚假，用谎言说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向你们预言得清酒和浓酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那人就必作这民的先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"雅各家啊，我必要聚集你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必要招聚以色列剩下的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安置在一处，如波斯拉的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如草场上的羊群；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为人数众多就必大大喧哗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"开路的","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"在他们前面上去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们直闯过城门，从城门出去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的王在前面行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华引导他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或译：假先知","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":6}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"或译：心肠狭窄吗","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":7}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或译：地","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":10}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"或译：破城的","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}